502
00:29:35,459 --> 00:29:37,253
<i>Well, looked that way from up here.</i>

503
00:29:37,461 --> 00:29:40,257
I don't know what I did to
you but whatever it was, I'm glad.

504
00:29:40,423 --> 00:29:42,466
I wish it had been worse.
I wish you died!

505
00:29:42,675 --> 00:29:46,969
<i>- Yes, finally some honesty.
- Just tell me who you are.</i>

506
00:29:47,180 --> 00:29:50,890
<i>No one you'd ever notice.
I don't run in your circles.</i>

507
00:29:51,100 --> 00:29:53,811
<i>- And what is it you do?
- I watch.</i>

508
00:29:54,019 --> 00:29:56,771
<i>- You watch?
- Yes, well, what else is there to do...</i>

509
00:29:56,981 --> 00:30:00,234
<i>... when life turns on you and you've
retreated into some small room?</i>

510
00:30:00,485 --> 00:30:01,776
<i>You look out your window.</i>

511
00:30:01,944 --> 00:30:05,655
<i>You see people come in and out of this
phone booth. The same ones every day.</i>

512
00:30:05,864 --> 00:30:08,866
