You imagine their stories.</i>

513
00:30:09,827 --> 00:30:13,038
<i>But eventually, you get tired
of imagining and follow one of them.</i>

514
00:30:14,332 --> 00:30:16,166
<i>And you hear all of his lies.</i>

515
00:30:16,376 --> 00:30:19,210
