should be punished.</i>

516
00:30:19,420 --> 00:30:23,924
<i>Some guy shouting into a cell phone full
of self-importance isn't gonna notice me.</i>

517
00:30:24,133 --> 00:30:29,221
<i>But I noticed that German porn king,
and I noticed that corrupt executive.</i>

518
00:30:29,430 --> 00:30:31,558
<i>And I noticed you, Stu.</i>

519
00:30:32,891 --> 00:30:36,686
- I'm flattered.
- Operator 553. What is your emergency?

520
00:30:36,895 --> 00:30:38,062
