536
00:31:36,538 --> 00:31:39,624
Shit. You bugged the fucking booth.

537
00:31:39,833 --> 00:31:42,209
That's how you knew.
That's how you knew about Pam.

538
00:31:42,418 --> 00:31:46,380
<i>- You picked the wrong person to lie to.
