615
00:35:35,107 --> 00:35:38,318
I ain't got no side of it,
and I didn't shoot anybody.

616
00:35:38,568 --> 00:35:40,403
You see a fucking gun
anywhere? Look.

617
00:35:40,654 --> 00:35:43,280
It's in your back pocket!
I see it! He been...

618
00:35:45,074 --> 00:35:47,869
