who saw you use it.

625
00:36:06,304 --> 00:36:08,138
They didn't see it
because it didn't happen!

626
00:36:08,390 --> 00:36:11,767
- Shut them up!
- He's dead, but it didn't happen?

627
00:36:12,018 --> 00:36:15,396
<i>- Then who did it?
- Mustn't tell him, Stu.</i>

628
00:36:15,604 --> 00:36:18,024
