- Careful, Stuart. Careful.</i>

634
00:36:33,664 --> 00:36:35,583
My psychiatrist.

635
00:36:35,791 --> 00:36:40,045
<i>- Excellent. I should've thought of that.
- I see. What's this doctor's name?</i>

636
00:36:40,254 --> 00:36:42,256
