1036
00:59:40,827 --> 00:59:44,456
Okay, how does this end?
Tell me how this ends.

1037
00:59:44,663 --> 00:59:46,417
<i>The stage is almost set.</i>

1038
00:59:46,665 --> 00:59:49,877
